# Cloudflare Pages: exclude these from the deployed static asset bundle.
# `functions/` should never be servable as a static file — it's server-side
# source, and while it contains no secret *values* (those are env-only), it
# does describe exactly how the auth handshake and validation work. Same
# reasoning for the rest: none of this is meant to be publicly downloadable.

functions/
integrations/
scripts/
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.example
.gitignore
.assetsignore
README.md
